      "message": "fix(2d): judge a Trochoidal slot against the finished part like the Slot\n\nThe Trochoidal slot's endpoints and width are typed by hand, but its\ndepth law fell to DepthLaw::None: a whole-model slot through a pocket\nwall posted with the stock aligned or turned, and one 3 mm under the\nfloor posted with the stock turned (the program sim refuses to judge).\ndepth_law_of now routes it through authored_law (Entity/Selection ->\nSection, Stock -> None) after the part_solid early return, so the op\ncarries blocking gouges and the post is refused by name. #1513's\nslot_fit refusal for a picked region is unchanged.\n\nAudit of the 2D kinds still at None is pinned in authored_law_tests;\nEngrave/Trace on a whole model filed as #1595.\n\nFixes #1593\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
